  <ferc:SpecialLawRespondentIncorporatedUnder id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">No, not incorporated under special law. Cheniere Corpus Christi Pipeline Company ("CCPL") was originally organized as a Delaware corporation on December 8, 2003. On March 31, 2006, CCPL filed a Certificate of Conversion in the State of Delaware, converting it to Cheniere Corpus Christi Pipeline, LP. Cheniere Corpus Christi Pipeline, LP filed a Certificate of Limited Partnership in the State of Delaware.</ferc:SpecialLawRespondentIncorporatedUnder>
