  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-12" contextRef="c-1">During the year, respondent owned and, through associated company relationships, operated a natural gas pipeline system and engaged in the transportation of natural gas in Texas.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
